天下虽广，汝欲求安足之地，其可得乎","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c97fbc22e62486ad902b","start":10,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-b6e414c3b422d7d76cf6","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-b737b099b25d173cc611","layer":"original","quote":"绍遣将攻之，连年不能拔。﹝五﹞建安四年，绍悉军围之〖9〗。瓒遣子求救于黑山贼","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-e2e2e45efc5af29edcc5","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-b737b099b25d173cc611","layer":"original","quote":"瓒自知必败，尽杀其妻子，乃自杀","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":311,"end":326,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
